WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:11.276
Social plans your posts for Facebook, Instagram, Google Business Profile, and LinkedIn, on one calendar. In this video, you’ll write a post with AI and see how posts did.

2
00:00:12.296 --> 00:00:22.685
Open Social. The calendar shows the week or the month, with every post at its time, its channels, and its status. Anything that needs attention is listed on the right.

3
00:00:23.708 --> 00:00:33.073
Click New post, pick the channels, and say what it’s about. AI writes a version for each channel in your brand voice, checked against each platform’s limits.

4
00:00:35.554 --> 00:00:40.525
Schedule it, send it for approval if you like, and Worklynq posts it at the time you chose.

5
00:00:41.546 --> 00:00:49.610
Results shows how every post did over the last week, month, or three months: views, reactions, comments, and shares, for each channel.

6
00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:54.004
That’s Social. Next, the Inbox for comments and reviews.

